/* Test for parsing/evaluation of linear expressions ===========================
 * Simple file to test the parser and evaluator. 
   WARNING: if this file is modified, the corresponding logs in parse/gt_data
   and eval/gt_data must be updated.
==============================================================================*/

|x+2|;
|3*x+5|;
|1/2*x+0|;
|1/2*x+5/4|;
|3/4*x+5/4|;

|1*x+2+2*x+5|;
|1*x+2-2*x+5|;
|1+(1+2)*x-3|;

inv(|3*x+2|);
compose(|1*x+0|, |1*x+0|);
compose(|2*x+3|, |1*x+5|);
